---@class gcp.unstable.datastore_v1beta3.RunAggregationQueryProjectsRequest
---@field readOptions? gcp.unstable.datastore_v1beta3.ReadOptions The options for this query.
---@field explainOptions? gcp.unstable.datastore_v1beta3.ExplainOptions Optional. Explain options for the query. If set, additional query statistics will be returned. If not, only query results will be returned.
---@field partitionId? gcp.unstable.datastore_v1beta3.PartitionId Entities are partitioned into subsets, identified by a partition ID. Queries are scoped to a single partition. This partition ID is normalized with the standard default context partition ID.
---@field gqlQuery? gcp.unstable.datastore_v1beta3.GqlQuery The GQL query to run. This query must be an aggregation query.
---@field aggregationQuery? gcp.unstable.datastore_v1beta3.AggregationQuery The query to run.
